        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bayraktar, Tb2, Kizilelma, Anka, UAV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command the ultimate combat drone and dominate the battlefield from above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Drone Strike</strong>, you pilot a single, fully customizable drone through a series of high-intensity missions — unlocking new weapons, upgrading systems, and calling in devastating air strikes when the fight gets tough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mission tests your precision, strategy, and reflexes. Equip your drone with powerful cannons, guided missiles, and experimental tech to adapt to different combat scenarios. Earn rewards, improve your load out, and become an unstoppable force in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy won’t see you coming — until it’s too late.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚙️ Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚀 <strong>One Drone, Endless Upgrades:</strong> Unlock and enhance weapons, armor, and support modules to fit your combat style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 <strong>Air Strike Support:</strong> Call in powerful air assaults to wipe out enemy forces in critical moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 <strong>Tactical Combat:</strong> Plan your approach, manage energy and ammo, and strike with precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Dynamic Missions:</strong> Engage in diverse operations — from covert eliminations to large-scale battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 <strong>Progression System:</strong> Earn currency, upgrade your gear, and evolve your drone into a deadly war machine.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
